--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Attribution / third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Container, label-shelf, foot-hollow and box-label geometry are measured
  from and derived from Pred's models:
    * Gridfinity Bin with Printable Label by Pred (parametric)
      https://www.printables.com/model/592545   (CC BY-NC 4.0)
    * Gridfinity Storage Box by Pred (now parametric)
      https://www.printables.com/model/543553   (fit target)

- The printable label-plate outline in src/gridfinity_container_builder/
  labelplate.py is ported from gflabel's PredBase
    https://github.com/ndevenish/gflabel   (BSD 3-Clause, (c) 2024 Nicholas
    Devenish). That portion remains under BSD 3-Clause.

- The interior scoop/ramp/test-gauge geometry (interior.py, text.py) is
  ported from the author's own screw-organiser project
    https://github.com/gheydon/screw-organiser

- Built on gridfinity-build123d
    https://github.com/Ruudjhuu/gridfinity_build123d
  and build123d (https://build123d.readthedocs.io/).

The CC BY-NC 4.0 licence above applies to this project's own contributions
and to the generated models. Third-party components keep their own licences
as noted.
